+# English
 
-## Privacy Policy
+Lumen is an Android app for researching a topic through YouTube videos: enter a word or phrase → AI suggests domains and refined queries → the app searches with filters → collects metadata, transcripts and comments → builds analytics and AI summaries with **your own** API key. All data stays on the device; search, collection and local analytics work without any key.
 
-The NewPipe project aims to provide a private, anonymous experience for using web-based media services. Therefore, the app does not collect any data without your consent. NewPipe's privacy policy explains in detail what data is sent and stored when you send a crash report, or leave a comment in our blog. You can find the document [here](https://newpipe.net/legal/privacy/).
+**Features:** projects with query sets and run history; AI domain refinement; search with sort, period (incl. custom range), duration, Shorts exclusion and limits; channel/playlist/link import; marking and labels; background collection of metadata, subtitles and comments with retries and resume; optional Gemini transcription; local analytics (trends, top channels, word cloud and phrases, top and fastest-growing videos, comparisons); AI per-video summaries (map-reduce), project summary, clusters, comment sentiment, project chat, editable prompts, token/cost estimates and caching; scheduled monitoring with notifications; CSV/JSON/Markdown/PDF export and ZIP backups; providers Gemini, OpenRouter, OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, Groq, Ollama/LM Studio and any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Material Design 3 UI with Material You dynamic colour and light/dark themes.
 
-## License
