 Lumen is an Android app for researching a topic through YouTube videos: enter a word or phrase → AI suggests domains and refined queries → the app searches with filters → collects metadata, transcripts and comments → builds analytics and AI summaries with **your own** API key. All data stays on the device; search, collection and local analytics work without any key.
 
-**Features:** projects with query sets and run history; AI domain refinement; search with sort, period (incl. custom range), duration, Shorts exclusion and limits; channel/playlist/link import; marking and labels; background collection of metadata, subtitles and comments with retries and resume; optional Gemini transcription; local analytics (trends, top channels, word cloud and phrases, top and fastest-growing videos, comparisons); AI per-video summaries (map-reduce), project summary, clusters, comment sentiment, project chat, editable prompts, token/cost estimates and caching; scheduled monitoring with notifications; CSV/JSON/Markdown/PDF export and ZIP backups; providers Gemini, OpenRouter, OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, Groq, Ollama/LM Studio and any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Material Design 3 UI with Material You dynamic colour and light/dark themes.
+**Features:** projects with query sets and run history; AI domain refinement; search with sort, period (incl. custom range), duration, Shorts exclusion and limits; channel/playlist/link import; marking and labels; background collection of metadata, subtitles and comments with retries and resume; optional Gemini transcription; local analytics (trends, top channels, word cloud and phrases, top and fastest-growing videos, comparisons); AI per-video summaries (map-reduce), project summary, clusters, comment sentiment, project chat, editable prompts, token/cost estimates and caching; YouTube recommendation explorer without an account (snowball by levels with default depth 10, autoplay chain, Mix; relevance and other filters; PageRank; drift by step) with an interactive graph and GEXF export; audience research (pains, questions, requests, objections without AI; AI insights with verified quotes, JTBD, unmet needs, content gaps; topic clusters); Audience-to-SEO pipeline (autocomplete phrasings with unknown volumes, qualification, brief, Markdown draft, QA, checklist, editor approval, manual Search Console metrics); scheduled monitoring with notifications and drip mode; CSV/JSON/Markdown/PDF export and ZIP backups; providers Gemini, OpenRouter, OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, Groq, Ollama/LM Studio and any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Material Design 3 UI with Material You dynamic colour and light/dark themes.
 
 **Get the APK:** fork → Actions → *Build APK* → artifact `lumen-debug-apk`. Push a `v*` tag for a release; add secrets `KEYSTORE_BASE64`, `KEYSTORE_PASSWORD`, `KEY_ALIAS`, `KEY_PASSWORD` to sign with your key (see the keytool commands above). Locally: JDK 21 + Android SDK, `./gradlew assembleDebug -DskipChecks`.
 
